/target
Cargo.lock
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
# Claude Code state/transcripts — can contain secrets. Never commit.
# Exception: committed skills under .claude/skills/ are repo content (integration
# guides), not personal state, so they ARE tracked.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
# qlty: the project config (`.qlty/qlty.toml` + configs) IS committed so the
# scan is repo-controlled; `.qlty/.gitignore` already ignores the cache/output.
